THE SHORT VERSION

Two different people own things in this repository, and the split matters.

THE CODE — the Flask application, templates, stylesheets and build scripts —
was written by Joshua Kay. It is public so the work can be read and judged. It
is not open source.

THE CONTENT — the business name, the product photography, the brochure text in
Thai and English, and everything describing the farm and its products —
belongs to T.P.A. Honey Farm. It appears here because the site was built for
them. None of it is mine to license to anybody, and it is not covered by
anything below.


WHAT YOU MAY DO

- Read the source code.
- Quote short extracts of the code in a review, article or teaching material,
  with attribution.


WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO WITHOUT WRITTEN PERMISSION

- Use this code, in whole or in part, in another project.
- Copy the design, layout or templates into another site.
- Use any of the photography, product descriptions, brochure text or branding.
  That permission is not mine to give — it is the farm's.
- Redistribute, republish, sell, sublicense or host this software.
- Remove or alter this notice.


ABOUT THE WORK

This site was built without charge, modernising an existing website for a
friend's business. It is shown as an example of work, not as a commercial
engagement.


